    "detailed_description": "You'll be following Neo, a young idol dissatisfied with her life. After suddenly moving to a new school for one week, she finds herself wrapped up in the school's student council and its (unofficial) idol group.<br><br>But all takes an unexpected turn once a simple accident causes our cast to delve deeper into the school's lower floor. During a series of investigations done by the astute Detective Emilia Ruth, your actions will determine the conclusion of the case as well as the story as a whole.<br><br><strong>So get ready to call the tune!</strong><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A mix of detective and idol games:</strong> You are provided with a variety of minigames and game mechanics to enrich the experience.<br><br></li><li><strong>Dynamic Storytelling:</strong> Every decision you make as Neo will influence the narrative. Your choices will shape relationships, uncover secrets, and determine the fate of the characters and the school itself.<br><br></li><li><strong>Inventory:</strong> During the game, you can find items that will unlock new interactions.<br><br></li><li><strong>Unlockable extra art:</strong> Some special events will reward you with extra art in the form of cards.</li></ul><br><br><strong>This game contains disturbing imagery that may be out of tune with some players.</strong>",
